    "answer": {
      "short": "No. $Q_1=49$, $Q_3=69$, IQR $=20$ and the upper fence is $99$. Since $96<99$, it is not an outlier.",
      "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}Q_1&=49,\\quad Q_3=69\\\\\\text{IQR}&=69-49=20\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=69+1.5\\times20=99\\end{aligned}$\n\nSince $96<99$, the mark of $96$ is not an outlier.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
